# 7. LLM INTERPRETATION REQUIREMENTS

The LLM is mandatory for operator-note interpretation.

The LLM must directly produce the structured operator-note interpretation used by the deterministic optimizer pipeline.

Using an AI model only for:

* plan_summary
* documentation
* cosmetic text

does NOT satisfy the requirement.

The LLM must actually interpret `operator_notes`.

## Important restriction

The LLM must NOT:

* generate the energy schedule
* calculate grid usage
* choose battery actions
* optimize tariffs
* change demand
* change solar data
* change tariffs
* change battery capacity
* invent directives
* invent fields
* produce executable math instructions

Its only task is natural-language interpretation.

