# 29. REPORTING METRICS

The hourly plan is the source of truth.

Never trust solver-summary metrics blindly.

Recalculate:

```text
total_grid_kwh
total_cost_bdt
peak_grid_kwh
```

from the final validated hourly plan.

Definitions:

```text
total_grid_kwh
=
sum(grid_kwh[h])
```

```text
total_cost_bdt
=
sum(
    grid_kwh[h] * tariff_bdt_per_kwh[h]
)
```

```text
peak_grid_kwh
=
max(grid_kwh[h])
```

Do not calculate these from intermediate optimizer values.

